ll you how to find the Antheia Bloom. But unfortunately, it is no longer here. Destroyed by those foul rotdogs! They eat them, among other things. But even that information may be of use to Giladan. Now go.'\nSpeak with Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nYou've brought Giladan the information he sought.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience (about 1.5 AAs at Level 90 or a little less than 1 AA at Level 95)\nFaction with Dream Delvers (+10)\n13 Dream Motes [item=90255]\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
