 'Kill?'\nMeikona the Keeper says 'Uh... My death would solve nothing... so... I will give you the information you seek, if that means you will [leave].'\nYou say, 'I'll leave if you tell me'\nMeikona the Keeper says 'Very well... The seeds of the Antheia Bloom are very resilient. They do not digest easily, if at all. You will have to take them from the rotdogs directly. There! I gave you what you wanted, whatever good that will do.'\nLoot 4 Antheia Bloom Seeds from rotdogs 0/4 (The Grounds)\n_Rotdogs drop the seeds._\n_NOTE: These are not pre-lootable._\nGive 4 Antheia Bloom Seeds to Giladan the Botanist 0/4 (The Grounds)\nSpeak with Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'You found them where?! I don't envy you at all! Ha, ha, ha! But I do thank you!'\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n13 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
