      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Grounds [zone=749]\n**Who:**\n- Giladan the Botanist [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 80\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bixie guard [npc=36107]\n- a wasp - The Grounds [npc=35732]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 00:03:32 2010\nModified: Sun Feb 15 15:44:34 2026 | | This is a solo kill task that begins with Giladan the Botanist [npc=36092] at location -65, -1700, -105 in the Grounds (due east of the zone-in; just east of the central garden and next to Spensur, the Rk. III spell NPC).\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'These blasted things won't let me get any [work] done! First it's those rude [peponnites], then the arrogant [tree] things, then the buzzing [bixies], then those flea infested [dogs], and finally that awful pond scum [snake] and its offspring! It's no wonder why this once beautiful place is gone in the gutter!'\nYou say, 'Bixies?'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'They are so vital to the pollination of all the plants here, that it was only natural that I would be interested in talking to them. But you know what I got for my trouble? Aggression and just all around bad manners! Maybe if you could... [persuade] them, if you know what I mean.'\nYou say, 'I'll persuade them...'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'You may want to exterminate some of their wasp helpers too.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Taking on the Hive'.\nGiladan has asked you to persuade the bixie hive into letting him into that area to speak with them.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Kill 6 bixies 0/6 (The Grounds)\n2\\. Kill 5 wasps 0/5 (The Grounds)\n3\\. Speak with Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'Thank you so much for your help. Perhaps now they will be more open to outsiders!'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
