      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Grounds [zone=749]\n**Who:**\n- Giladan the Botanist [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a souring treant [npc=35738]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 00:03:36 2010\nModified: Thu Jul 28 14:50:45 2011 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Giladan the Botanist at location -65, -1700, -105 in the Grounds (due east of the zone-in; just east of the central garden and next to Spensur, the Rk. III spell NPC)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'These blasted things won't let me get any [work] done! First it's those rude [peponnites], then the arrogant [tree] things, then the buzzing [bixies], then those flea infested [dogs], and finally that awful pond scum [snake] and its offspring! It's no wonder why this once beautiful place is gone in the gutter!'\nYou say, 'What about those tree things?'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'There are some very peculiar trees in the orchard, but the treants won't let me do my work. Maybe if you [cleared] out some of them I will have a short opportunity to get what I need.'\nYou say, 'I'll see them cleared'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'Thank you. Just a handful would probably help.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Bigger They Are'.\nGiladan needs you to thin out the number of treants in the orchard so that he can study the trees there.\n\n---\n\nKill 5 souring treants 0/5 (The Grounds)\n_Souring treants are found in the northwestern part of the zone as well as the southeastern section._\nSpeak with Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nYour task 'The Bigger They Are' has been updated.\nGiladan the Botanist says 'Excellent! Thank you so much!'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
