      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Grounds [zone=749]\n**Who:**\n- Grithlan Vraniq [npc=36109]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Zones:**\n- Feerrott, the Dream [zone=747]\n- The Foundation [zone=709]\n- The Grounds [zone=749]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Orloh [npc=35822]\n- Shalma [npc=35810]\n- Weaver [npc=37450]\n- Weavers bodyguard [npc=37451]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 00:17:09 2010\nModified: Sun Apr 7 14:12:14 2024 | | _This solo task begins with Grithlan Vraniq in the Grounds. He is located at -185, -1935, -223._\nYou say, 'Hail, Grithlan Vraniq'\nGrithlan Vraniq says 'Thank the gods! I've been waiting for what seems like an eternity for someone who can [help] me!'\nYou say, 'Help you how?'\nGrithlan Vraniq says 'I've been trapped in this damnable place for many seasons now searching for my [Deirdre]. She'd come to see the garden, but unfortunately, I could not come with her as I was away at the time. But when I returned, I found that she had not.'\nYou say, 'Deirdre?'\nGrithlan Vraniq says 'I know she traveled through many places to get here, so I started here. But I've not been able to leave this place! If you could [assist] me, I'd be eternally grateful!'\nYou say, 'I'll assist you'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Last One'.\nGrithlan is looking for his lost love Deidre. Help him find out what her fate was and help him find his way back to her.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak with Orloh in the Feerrott 0/1 (Feerrott, the Dream)\n_You can find Orloh at location -255, 535, -10._\nYou say, 'Hail, Orloh'\nOrloh says 'What you [want]? No time for chit chat. No time at all. Time!'\nYou say, 'I want to know about Grithlan'\nOrloh says 'Grithlan? I know no [Grithlan]! Nonsense! You bug me with nonsense! Nonsense!'\nYou say, 'You know Grithlan...'\nOrloh says 'I told you...Oh yes... [Remember] him I do. Remember.'\nYou say, 'What do you remember?'\nOrloh says 'Not my business. No business of mine. And no [business] of yours too, if you know what is good for you. No business.'\nYou say, 'What business?'\nOrloh says 'As I told him, the garden is no place to visit. He did not listen, and seen him no more have I. Him or his girl. His [girl].'\nYou say, 'His girl?'\nOrloh says 'So he got you looking for [her] eh? Sucker born... blah, blah, blah. Sucker!'\nYou say, 'Who is 'her'?'\nOrloh says 'Tell you same thing I told him. Same thing. She came here looking to get passage to the garden. But she talked to Weaver.'\nYou say, 'Weaver?'\nOrloh says 'How should I know where he is? Do I look like his keeper? No I do not. Do not! [Shalma] is who you need to speak with. Speak with.'\nYou say, 'Shalma?'\nOrloh says 'Shalma is partnered with Weaver! She is around here somewhere. Perhaps near the temple. Always poking her nose into things that don't concern her. Concern her!'\n2\\. Find and speak with Shalma 0/1 (Feerrott, the Dream)\n_Shalma can be found in the Feerrott at location -1110, 630._\nYou say, 'Hail, Shalma'\nShalma says 'Greetings stranger. What can Shalma [do] for you?'\nYou say, 'Here's what you can do...'\nShalma says 'Weaver is not available right now, but I am sure Shalma can [help] you.'\nYou say, 'Help me...'\nShalma says 'You are wasting my time, something I value. As I told you Weaver is not [here]!'\nYou say, 'He's not here?'\nShalma says 'Fine! Enough! He went to the Underfoot. Had some business in Foundation. '\n3\\. Kill the bodyguards that protect Weaver 0/5 (The Foundation)\n_When you zone into the Foundation, hug the right wall take the tunnel. You'll arrive at the Weaver camp._\n_The bodyguards are KOS, but don't aggro. You can talk to Weaver first if you want, or kill the five bodyguards and then talk._\n_They are snarable and don't summon._\n4\\. Speak to Weaver about Grithlan 0/1 (The Foundation)\nYou say, 'Hail, Weaver'\nWeaver says 'Shalma needs to learn to keep her mouth shut! What do you [want]?'\nYou say, 'I want to know about Grithlan'\nWeaver says 'Grithlan??? That fool? I told him his search was futile. The garden is not the place in which one would want to be lost. Many travelers have been lost there. Especially because of what they do to [people] that do go there.'\nYou say, 'People?'\nWeaver says 'They change them! How do you think they get the many servants that roam that place? That was most likely her fate at the hands of the garden.'\n5\\. Tell Grithlan what you have found out 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grithlan Vraniq'\nGrithlan Vraniq says 'Weaver did tell me that. But I refuse to believe that until I see it with my own eyes! You must find her! If she made it here, I am sure there are others who have seen her. But they will not talk to me. I am ignored like I am not even here!'\n6\\. Speak to Ikaena about Deirdre 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Ikaena is found in a building in the northeastern corner of the Grounds. There are numerous bone casters and bone golems around the area, many of which see invisibility._\nYou say, 'Hail, Ikaena the Bonesmith'\nIkaena the Bonesmith says 'I have not seen anyone like you describe. But it is true that she may have fallen to the hands of the servants.'\n7\\. Speak to Meikona about Deirdre 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Meikona the Keeper is in a building inside the bixie fort in the south-central part of the Grounds._\nYou say, 'Hail, Meikona the Keeper'\nMeikona the Keeper says 'Can you not just leave us be?! I have not seen who you are looking for!'\n8\\. Speak to Giladan about Deirdre 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'Hmm. . . very interesting indeed. I do recall seeing a young woman some time ago. But it was just once, and I never saw her again. But she did ask for directions to the maze.'\n9\\. Search the maze for Deirdre 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Find Deirdre in the hedge maze in the north-central part of the zone._\nYou say, 'Hail, Deirdre'\nDeirdre says 'You have freed me. For that I am in your debt. Please tell Grithlan that I will see him again, where we can spend eternity together.'\n10\\. Kill 4 servants of Thule 0/4 (The Grounds)\n11\\. Return to Grithlan Vraniq 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grithlan Vraniq'\nYou have found out the fate of Deirdre and helped Grithlan so that they can be together again.\nGrithlan Vraniq says, 'You found her?! My dear Deirdre? She has gone to a better [place]. Of that, I am certain.'\nYou say, 'You're dead, brother. You and her are in the same place.'\nGrithlan Vraniq says, 'I am what? Dead? How can that be? I remember... I remember... I fell to the serpent of the pond. I remember now. That is why I could not leave. That is why no one would listen. It all makes [sense].'\nYou say, 'Now that this all makes sense... What will you do?'\nGrithlan Vraniq says, 'I can now be at peace. I can move on and be with Deirdre forever. Thank you. You have done so much for me. I must go now. My Deirdre will be waiting.'\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience (about 2.5 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers has been adjusted by 10\n13 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
    },
