      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Grounds [zone=749]\n**Who:**\n- Paltra Harins [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 80\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Fetid Venom [item=93034]\n- Heart of the Profane [item=94298]\n- Unknown Blood [item=94880]\n- Unknown Claw [item=94869]\n- Unknown Hair [item=94879]\n- Unknown Scale [item=94868]\n**Related Zones:**\n- House of Thule, Lower Floors [zone=748]\n- House of Thule, Upper Floors [zone=753]\n- The Well [zone=750]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Alboct Vinn [npc=35796]\n- Constable Erulin [npc=36338]\n- Dtaemi [ _Quests_]\n- Fetid Spider [npc=36125]\n- Granger Rivenbel [npc=36553]\n- Profane Fiend [npc=36312]\n- Vorga the Anathema [npc=37099]\n- Vorga the Killer [npc=37100]\n- first missing bonecrafter [npc=36098]\n- fourth missing bonecrafter [npc=36101]\n- garden bandit [npc=37101]\n- garden hooligan [npc=37102]\n- garden outlaw [npc=37103]\n- second missing bonecrafter [npc=36099]\n- third missing bonecrafter [npc=36100]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Giladan #1: Giladan's Assistant [quest=5157]\n- Giladan #2: What a Mess [quest=5158]\n- Giladan #3: It Only Gets Worse [quest=5159]\n- The Last One [quest=5172]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 00:30:11 2010\nModified: Tue Apr 2 21:11:58 2024 | | _This solo task begins with Paltra Harins in the Grounds. She is found in the building in the northeastern part of the zone. Location approximately 400, -2490._\n_You must have completed the other four Partisan solo tasks for The Grounds before you can request this one. (Giladan's three tasks as well as \"The Last One\")_\n_You will be required to have access to Tier 3 zones in order to complete this task. (See this link for progression information.)_\nYou say, 'Hail, Paltra Harins'\nPaltra Harins says 'Greetings traveler. I am hoping you can help me with [something].'\nYou say, 'Something?'\nPaltra Harins says 'It seems we have a number of people missing. And unfortunately, our [constable] is unlikely to find out for himself the whereabouts of our missing bonecrafters.'\nYou say, 'Constable?'\nPaltra Harins says 'His fear keeps him close to home. My only fear is that more of my kinsmen will fall to whatever force is at work here, be it man or monster. Will you [find] our missing compatriots?'\nYou say, 'I will find them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dissolution of Reason'.\nPaltra Harins says 'If you are able to discover the identity of who, or what, is responsible, please put a stop to it... in our name. Be sure to speak to Constable Erulin if you find anything.'\n\n---\n\nFind the 1st missing bonecrafter 0/1 (The Grounds)\nFind the 2nd missing bonecrafter 0/1 (The Grounds)\nFind the 3rd missing bonecrafter 0/1 (The Grounds)\nFind the 4th missing bonecrafter 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_NOTE: For each hail, you will be ambushed by three mobs (\"garden \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\"), but you don't actually have to kill them as part of the task._\nSpeak to Constable Erulin 0/1 (The Grounds)\nGive Granger Rivenbel the claw you found 0/1 (The Grounds)\nGive Granger Rivenbel the hair you found 0/1 (The Grounds)\nGive Granger Rivenbel the blood you found 0/1 (The Grounds)\nGive Granger Rivenbel the scale you found 0/1 (The Grounds)\nSpeak to Granger Rivenbel 0/1 (The Grounds)\nSpeak to Dtaemi 0/1 (The Well)\nKill the Fetid Spider 0/1 (The Well)\nGive the Fetid Venom to the Granger Rivenbel 0/1 (The Grounds)\nSpeak to Granger Rivenbel 0/1 (The Grounds)\nSpeak to Alboct Vinn 0/1 (House of Thule)\n_Alboct Vinn is a dwarf in the eastern half of the courtyard in the House of Thule's lower floors._\nFind and kill the Profane Fiend 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\n_Location for thulehouse2.txt mapfile:_\nP 608.7167, -133.8700, 68.4953, 127, 0, 0, 3, Profane\\_Fiend\n_If going through the halls of the zone's southeastern wing, it's the first door that leads to a dead-end area, on your right._\nLoot the Heart of the Profane 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nTake the Heart of the Profane to the east shore of the lake 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_WARNING: If you have more than one person in your group who's on this step, they should stay far away from the quest NPCs at the lake. If you have multiple people on this task and everyone is at the eastern edge of the lake, all but one person will lose their item and have to repeat the entire task._\nUpdate is very near where Riggbit [npc=35931] spawns, on the east coast of the lake southern half. You might need to remove Levitate.\nSpeak to Vorga the Anathema 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Hail Vorga and say \"trickery\" to him to spawn a KOS \"Vorga the Killer\"._\nKill Vorga the Anathema 0/1 (The Grounds)\nSpeak to Paltra Harins 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience (about 2.5 AAs)\nFaction\n13 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
